cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Budget-Constrained Embodied Perception: Four Resource Walls, and a Pre-Registered
  Evaluation of Access-Structured Perception on Open Multimodal Models at <=31B"
message: "If you use this artifact, please cite the paper."
type: software
abstract: >
  Pre-registration, protocol, corpus generator, and complete per-question measurement records
  for the ASP (Access-Structured Perception) study: four resource walls for budgeted embodied
  perception, and an equal-budget evaluation of seven access structures over seven open
  multimodal backbones on the synthetic SEW-Bench corpus.
keywords:
  - embodied perception
  - multimodal foundation models
  - inference budget
  - pre-registration
  - access structure
license: Apache-2.0
license-url: "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0"
repository-code: "https://github.com/wenhui-ml/access-structured-perception"
